WEBVTT

00:01:38.630 --> 00:01:41.740
H-Help me...

00:02:22.770 --> 00:02:24.330
Deus Catena!

00:02:38.430 --> 00:02:40.970
We will now begin the Sealing Ceremony.

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:52.610
By the power of the Sealing Treasure, 
the Sword of God, the Holy Mirror,

00:02:53.070 --> 00:02:58.600
the evil dragon Dagan Zot, will be 
sealed in a prison of eternal time!

00:03:01.740 --> 00:03:04.330
You have wrought disaster on this land,

00:03:05.730 --> 00:03:07.670
you have devoured countless souls,

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:12.080
and scorched the land until
not even grass will grow!

00:03:13.370 --> 00:03:14.840
For these crimes...

00:03:22.520 --> 00:03:23.680
Lord Bairo!

00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:25.600
Dear!

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:26.640
Don't!

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:29.350
Continue the sealing ceremony,

00:03:29.910 --> 00:03:38.440
or the soul destroying flames of 
Dagan Zot will devour this land!

00:03:54.940 --> 00:03:56.290
Hiiro!

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:58.170
Hiiro!

00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:01.090
My son!

00:04:57.690 --> 00:04:59.110
You can go.

00:04:59.410 --> 00:05:00.170
Next.

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:05.950
Show me your face.

00:05:13.420 --> 00:05:14.970
Y-You can go.

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:27.780
That's—!

00:05:35.810 --> 00:05:40.390
Nambuuko-sama's coming through!

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:48.550
Hop!

00:05:59.780 --> 00:06:03.500
Blessings upon the people of Iinsekise.

00:06:22.590 --> 00:06:23.440
Peshate!

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:26.030
Don't take Nambuuko's money!

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:30.280
He's just spreading around 
the money he took from us!

00:06:31.350 --> 00:06:36.040
If I was going to get something from 
Nambuuko, I'd want a Grand Trowa.

00:06:36.990 --> 00:06:40.620
You can bring out all the 
money and food you want.

00:06:40.890 --> 00:06:43.150
Could you eat all you wanted?

00:06:43.150 --> 00:06:44.530
You're so dumb.

00:06:44.530 --> 00:06:46.580
It'll grant any wish you have.

00:06:46.580 --> 00:06:48.020
Let's go.

00:06:48.020 --> 00:06:50.630
We need to hurry or the boss will get mad.

00:06:50.630 --> 00:06:51.700
Right.

00:06:52.340 --> 00:06:54.260
Come on, let's go, Peshate.

00:06:54.790 --> 00:06:55.590
Yeah.

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:14.800
Giruu was right.

00:07:15.810 --> 00:07:18.120
There are a lot of different people in town.

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:24.130
A rat snuck in, huh?

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:31.730
And at the same time, our Dalhalbart arrives!

00:07:31.730 --> 00:07:34.720
He saves the golden maiden, Pishuktram.

00:07:35.020 --> 00:07:40.730
The raging dragon stomps the ground, with 
claws that could rend an elephant in twain!

00:07:40.940 --> 00:07:44.730
Will he be able to defeat the dragon?

00:07:44.970 --> 00:07:48.470
You all know the story of Dalhalbart.

00:07:48.470 --> 00:07:51.400
My ancestors inherited his crest!

00:07:51.610 --> 00:07:54.920
This is it! The Crest of Dragon-Warding!

00:07:55.600 --> 00:07:56.890
It's a fake, isn't it?

00:07:56.890 --> 00:07:59.580
There's been no sign of 
Dagan Zot for ten years.

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:01.460
We don't need it.

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:02.990
What are you saying?

00:08:02.990 --> 00:08:06.200
Look at this. It's real.

00:08:09.090 --> 00:08:11.230
You thief!

00:08:13.820 --> 00:08:15.270
Hakkai!

00:08:19.610 --> 00:08:22.360
Let me go, you jerk!

00:08:22.360 --> 00:08:25.660
Hakkai! Punch him two or three times!

00:08:32.120 --> 00:08:38.770
A swordsman must never draw his 
blade unless it is necessary.

00:08:38.770 --> 00:08:41.160
He's holding that huge sword in one hand?

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:43.370
He must be a real master of the blade!

00:08:43.690 --> 00:08:48.410
He stole the crest that 
is my family's treasure!

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:53.040
Will that do?

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:55.840
This is real gold!

00:08:56.510 --> 00:08:59.780
Thank you for giving me so much!

00:08:59.780 --> 00:09:00.720
Let's go!

00:09:04.700 --> 00:09:06.790
Ow...

00:09:06.790 --> 00:09:07.990
You okay?

00:09:07.990 --> 00:09:10.020
You should've minded your own business.

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:20.370
The plan was for me to cause a fuss and then
my buddies would steal those idiots' wallets.

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:22.420
You wasted a lot of my time.

00:09:23.480 --> 00:09:26.060
I'm taking this as a fee.

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:30.870
My Dalhalbart!

00:09:36.490 --> 00:09:39.010
Our plan got interrupted.

00:09:39.220 --> 00:09:41.610
If it weren't for that 
goody-two shoes swordsman,

00:09:41.610 --> 00:09:43.680
we could've made a lot of money.

00:09:45.110 --> 00:09:45.990
You!

00:09:45.990 --> 00:09:47.440
I'm taking this back!

00:09:48.710 --> 00:09:49.610
When did he...

00:09:49.610 --> 00:09:50.980
...get in here?

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:54.860
You came to steal that cheap 
trinket from a fairy tale?

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:56.400
You're persistent.

00:09:57.320 --> 00:09:58.640
I'm Hiiro.

00:09:58.640 --> 00:09:59.740
What's your name?

00:10:01.870 --> 00:10:03.000
Your name?

00:10:05.150 --> 00:10:06.070
Tomitte.

00:10:07.090 --> 00:10:08.730
So what?

00:10:10.470 --> 00:10:11.690
Tomitte, huh?

00:10:13.280 --> 00:10:14.590
Tomitte.

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:16.800
This is my Dalhalbart!

00:10:18.520 --> 00:10:19.260
Hey!

00:10:22.340 --> 00:10:25.610
What we stole belongs to us.

00:10:25.610 --> 00:10:28.480
What will you do, swordsman?

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:33.050
This.

00:10:40.840 --> 00:10:41.540
Huh?

00:10:41.540 --> 00:10:42.910
That bastard!

00:10:49.260 --> 00:10:51.240
Have you seen this young man?

00:10:52.520 --> 00:10:54.460
N-Never.

00:10:54.460 --> 00:10:56.340
Sorry.

00:11:00.230 --> 00:11:02.710
Palupa, you sure this is the right town?

00:11:02.710 --> 00:11:06.310
This would definitely be 
the first place he'd hit.

00:11:08.590 --> 00:11:10.720
I'm not joking!

00:11:11.410 --> 00:11:17.570
And anyway that brat took a full 
month's worth of living expenses!

00:11:17.570 --> 00:11:19.190
We'll find him.

00:11:19.800 --> 00:11:21.320
Wait!

00:11:21.320 --> 00:11:24.210
My legs aren't that long!

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:32.420
I'm just a mere merchant.

00:11:32.850 --> 00:11:37.270
I couldn't force you to do anything, my lord.

00:11:38.210 --> 00:11:42.110
But if I sell you all that magicite,

00:11:42.110 --> 00:11:46.890
the price will go up and the 
people will make a fuss.

00:11:46.890 --> 00:11:51.760
It's simple to silence the masses, isn't it?

00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:56.980
Sorry, I dropped it.

00:11:56.980 --> 00:11:58.440
That was an important pot!

00:12:04.470 --> 00:12:05.960
This is it.

00:12:08.550 --> 00:12:12.560
Fear is the simplest way 
to control the people.

00:12:19.270 --> 00:12:20.630
The Grand Trowa!

00:12:20.860 --> 00:12:24.530
If you like, we'll use it for your benefit.

00:12:27.190 --> 00:12:29.280
For me?

00:12:30.360 --> 00:12:31.470
But...

00:12:31.470 --> 00:12:34.150
I can't do it directly.

00:12:34.950 --> 00:12:37.950
My reputation among the people will suffer.

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:43.270
You can make as many excuses as you need.

00:12:44.110 --> 00:12:48.170
Sometimes they just come rolling in.

00:12:57.470 --> 00:13:00.420
I found a rat!

00:13:06.830 --> 00:13:08.080
See?

00:13:09.370 --> 00:13:11.210
The excuses just...

00:13:12.890 --> 00:13:15.080
...come rolling in.

00:14:09.830 --> 00:14:11.450
Wait!

00:14:15.790 --> 00:14:17.120
That bastard!

00:14:21.250 --> 00:14:22.750
Wait!

00:15:01.200 --> 00:15:02.880
Don't screw up like that!

00:15:15.200 --> 00:15:16.770
Boss!

00:15:17.120 --> 00:15:19.000
Peshate got caught!

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:19.680
What?

00:15:19.930 --> 00:15:21.060
Peshate?!

00:15:21.060 --> 00:15:24.510
He tried to steal the Grand Trowa!

00:15:24.510 --> 00:15:25.550
From Nambuuko?

00:15:25.550 --> 00:15:26.540
Yeah.

00:15:26.540 --> 00:15:28.360
He's going to be executed at dawn!

00:15:31.300 --> 00:15:32.860
That idiot!

00:15:33.300 --> 00:15:34.570
Boss!

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:38.540
H-Hey, are we done playing tag?

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:39.980
We don't have time!

00:15:39.980 --> 00:15:41.690
One of our friends was caught!

00:15:45.340 --> 00:15:47.220
Friends, huh?

00:15:53.330 --> 00:15:55.180
Listen up, folks.

00:15:55.180 --> 00:16:00.450
This little brat snuck 
into the lord's palace.

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:04.940
The lord has ordered his execution.

00:16:05.540 --> 00:16:12.340
The ultimate punishment is only fitting for 
those who fail to respect your authority.

00:16:12.340 --> 00:16:13.860
That's right.

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:18.490
Boss.

00:16:18.490 --> 00:16:19.830
I know.

00:16:20.160 --> 00:16:22.260
But there's nothing we can do!

00:16:23.550 --> 00:16:24.850
Leave it to me!

00:16:26.330 --> 00:16:27.480
What are you doing?

00:16:28.120 --> 00:16:30.990
A hero never leaves a good deed undone.

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:38.140
Behold the fate of those who 
sneak into the lord's palace!

00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:39.630
Let him go!

00:16:40.490 --> 00:16:44.650
I won't say he's innocent, but the 
death penalty is going too far.

00:16:44.650 --> 00:16:45.850
Who are you?

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:49.990
I am Hiiro!

00:16:49.990 --> 00:16:51.570
A wandering swordsman!

00:16:52.050 --> 00:16:54.020
A wandering swordsman?

00:16:55.500 --> 00:16:57.870
That's hilarious!

00:16:57.870 --> 00:17:01.540
Guys, have fun with him.

00:17:03.570 --> 00:17:05.960
It's been a long time since 
I've had goosebumps like this!

00:17:05.960 --> 00:17:08.670
That's the guy from last night!

00:17:14.680 --> 00:17:18.890
You must not draw your sword unless...

00:17:21.930 --> 00:17:22.960
it's necessary!

00:17:26.340 --> 00:17:27.960
Don't make me mad!

00:17:29.970 --> 00:17:31.270
If you do,

00:17:33.460 --> 00:17:35.720
I will have to draw my blade!

00:17:35.720 --> 00:17:36.860
Try it!

00:17:38.530 --> 00:17:44.370
Lightning Flashy-flash Stingy-sting Charge!

00:18:07.380 --> 00:18:08.540
He didn't cut us?

00:18:10.870 --> 00:18:13.020
I was sure I'd cut you.

00:18:15.030 --> 00:18:16.810
Are you screwing with us?

00:18:17.870 --> 00:18:21.170
What are you trying to do 
with that paring knife?

00:18:21.170 --> 00:18:22.030
What?!

00:18:24.150 --> 00:18:25.730
W-Wait—

00:18:25.730 --> 00:18:27.580
You want to talk this out?

00:18:28.390 --> 00:18:30.880
Hiiro-sama!

00:18:34.890 --> 00:18:36.210
Who is that guy?

00:18:38.750 --> 00:18:40.640
Where'd the kid go?

00:18:41.520 --> 00:18:43.720
I've been searching for you, Young Master.

00:18:45.080 --> 00:18:46.390
Don't call me young master!

00:18:46.920 --> 00:18:48.140
Young Master Hiiro.

00:18:48.560 --> 00:18:49.910
I told you...

00:18:51.370 --> 00:18:56.110
This is your fault for telling him it
would only take ten years for him

00:18:56.110 --> 00:18:58.010
to be a master swordsman!

00:18:58.010 --> 00:18:59.490
I am a swordsman!

00:19:00.550 --> 00:19:03.800
Then how much better have 
you gotten with that blade?

00:19:05.180 --> 00:19:09.980
The idea that you could defeat Dagon 
Zot at your level isn't even funny.

00:19:09.980 --> 00:19:12.120
It's chilling.

00:19:12.120 --> 00:19:14.670
Why are you talking when 
you should be fighting?

00:19:15.010 --> 00:19:18.050
I'll execute you all!

00:19:18.970 --> 00:19:22.050
Behold the power of the Grand Trowa!

00:19:24.020 --> 00:19:26.510
My father's sealing treasure!

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:30.980
<i>Could he be from...?</i>

00:19:31.460 --> 00:19:33.690
What are you talking about?

00:19:33.690 --> 00:19:36.860
This is Nambuuko-sama's Grand Trowa!

00:19:37.170 --> 00:19:39.540
It grants any wish.

00:19:40.100 --> 00:19:43.030
Even killing you.

00:19:43.920 --> 00:19:45.790
That belongs to my father.

00:19:45.790 --> 00:19:47.080
Give it back!

00:19:47.780 --> 00:19:52.670
A swordsman must never draw his 
blade unless it is necessary.

00:19:52.670 --> 00:19:53.540
But...

00:19:57.090 --> 00:19:58.470
Now is that time!

00:20:00.100 --> 00:20:05.180
Was everything he said something 
that old guy told him?

00:20:05.470 --> 00:20:06.950
I'm bored now.

00:20:06.950 --> 00:20:09.770
I'll send you all to hell.

00:20:10.320 --> 00:20:14.600
Now behold the power of the Grand Trowa!

00:20:20.560 --> 00:20:23.150
The show's over.

00:20:23.560 --> 00:20:30.120
This is my 
Ultra-Super-Deluxe-Gorgeous-Ultimate Magic!

00:20:31.620 --> 00:20:33.460
Die!

00:21:00.920 --> 00:21:02.220
Wh-What is this?

00:21:02.220 --> 00:21:04.120
Get back, Young Master.

00:21:04.120 --> 00:21:05.490
Stop calling me that!

00:21:13.060 --> 00:21:13.910
That can't be...

00:21:30.840 --> 00:21:33.180
The evil dragon Dagan Zot!

00:21:35.430 --> 00:21:37.000
It's alive?

00:23:44.210 --> 00:23:47.820
<i>Holy War Cerberus: Fatalité of Dragon Time.</i>

00:23:47.820 --> 00:23:55.780
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:48.270 --> 00:23:50.970
Episode 02: "The Dark Crystal."

00:23:51.960 --> 00:23:54.360
My blade shakes quietly.

00:23:55.780 --> 00:24:01.500
<b>Look Forward to the Next Episode!!</b>
